Subject: [PATCH 5/6] [Perf][Attention] FlashInfer test: name the
 fixed_split_size case by what it does

fixed_split_size counts pages, not tokens: fixed_split_size=block_size
splits KV into chunks of block_size pages, not into one-page chunks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: gf239 <gf239@users.noreply.github.com>
