Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:03:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] [Perf][Attention] Adapt the tests to #57214, #56531 and
 the padded prompt tail test

Since #57214 the FlashInfer builder takes the upper bound as exact when
there is no speculative decoding. The bounds in the builder tests count
drafts, so those builders now report NUM_SPEC speculative tokens.

test_padded_prompt_tail_builds_as_spec_decode and the input batch that
#56531 builds by hand in test_mamba_hybrid_model_state get the lower
bound field the attention metadata now reads.

